### Limitations

| Limitation | Description |
|---|---|
| **Self-authored** | Normain wrote this benchmark — the use cases, the prompts, the rubric. We mitigate bias through the fairness check (Method) and by describing the methodology in full. |
| **Selection bias** | We picked workloads where document Q&A at scale is the bottleneck — that's where Normain competes. Other workloads (creative writing, code, free-form chat) would likely produce a different ranking. |
| **Snapshot** | Tool versions and prompt-handling change. Runs are dated; rerunning months later may show different numbers, especially for tools under active development. |
| **Grading** | LLM-as-judge with human spot-checks on contested rows, not exhaustive human review. |

